"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m003-0427","start":427,"end":429,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"djb_njc_1kd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m003-0441","start":441,"end":444,"surface":"其從者","kind":"person","person_id":"aez_p66_9uj","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin","book_id":"b-shiji-081","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-081-lianlin"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p004","text":"秦王齋五日後，乃設九賓禮於廷，引趙使者藺相如。相如至，謂秦王曰：「秦自繆公以來二十餘君，未嘗有堅明約束者也。臣誠恐見欺於王而負趙，故令人持璧歸，間至趙矣。且秦彊而趙弱，大王遣一介之使至趙，趙立奉璧來。今以秦之彊而先割十五都予趙，趙豈敢留璧而得罪於大王乎？臣知欺大王之罪當誅，臣請就湯鑊，唯大王與群臣孰計議之。」秦王與群臣相視而嘻。左右或欲引相如去，秦王因曰：「今殺相如，終不能得璧也，而絶秦趙之驩，不如因而厚遇之，使歸趙，趙王豈以一璧之故欺秦邪！」卒廷見相如，畢禮而歸之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"djb_njc_1kd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"藺相如","kind":"person","person_id":"mjy_lip_a2o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"mjy_lip_a2o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"djb_njc_1kd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"pwa_tqs_k31","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0039","start":39,"end":43,"surface":"二十餘君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未定成員保存，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0087","start":87,"end":91,"surface":"一介之使","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未定成員保存，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未定成員保存，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0155","start":155,"end":157,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"djb_njc_1kd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未定成員保存，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未定成員保存，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0170","start":170,"end":172,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"mjy_lip_a2o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0174","start":174,"end":176,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"djb_njc_1kd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"mjy_lip_a2o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0211","start":211,"end":213,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"d9b_5t4_9eb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m004-0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"mjy_lip_a2o","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin","book_id":"b-shiji-081","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-081-lianlin"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p007","text":"秦王使使者告趙王，欲與王爲好會於西河外澠池。趙王畏秦，欲毋行。廉頗、藺相如計曰：「王不行，示趙弱且怯也。」趙王遂行，相如從。廉頗送至境，與王訣曰：「王行，度道裏會遇之禮畢，還，不過三十日。三十日不還，則請立太子爲王。以絶秦望。」王許之，遂與秦王會澠池。秦王飲酒酣，曰：「寡人竊聞趙王好音，請奏瑟。」趙王鼓瑟。秦禦史前書曰「某年月日，秦王與趙王會飲，令趙王鼓瑟」。藺相如前曰：「趙王竊聞秦王善爲秦聲，請奏盆鮓秦王，以相娯樂。」秦王怒，不許。於是相如前進鮓，因跪請秦王。秦王不肯撃鮓。相如曰：「五歩之内，相如請得以頸血濺大王矣！」左右欲刃相如，相如張目叱之，左右皆靡。於是秦王不懌，爲一撃鮓。相如顧召趙禦史書曰「某年月日，秦王爲趙王撃鮓」。秦之群臣曰：「請以趙十五城爲秦王壽」。藺相如亦曰：「請以秦之咸陽爲趙王壽。」秦王竟酒，終不能加勝於趙。趙亦盛設兵以待秦，秦不敢動。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m007-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"dj